        # The F1 consequence, stated in the landing log and
        # pinned here rather than absorbed: the imputation
        # makes NO sparsity exception — one censored record
        # on each side of a unit (89 numeric of 90 planned
        # per side, dominance holding on the numeric
        # population) renders the unit censored-unpaired and
        # the dimension UNEVALUATED. A PASS certifies only
        # units whose every planned record was measured.
        recs = complete_records()
